{"error": false, "page": 2, "prepage": 100, "pageCount": 2, "recordCount": 108, "data": [{"docid2": 1558696, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "环境监管", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/hjjg/202008/t20200812_1558696.htm", "content": "\n　　为深入贯彻落实习近平生态文明思想，打好“十大攻坚” 会战，以更大的力度推进生态环境保护工作，大田县湖美乡先行先试，秉承“大生态大环保”理念，实行“多长合一”，通过人力重组、职责整合、片区划分，探索", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/hjjg/202008/t20200812_1558696.htm", "docreltime": "2020.08.12 11:56:00", "doctitle": "大田县成立首支乡镇生态综合管护队", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1642097, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/hjjg/202008/t20200812_1558696.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/hjjg/202008/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1552185, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "环境监管", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/hjjg/202007/t20200720_1552185.htm", "content": "\n　　一是领导重视，高位推动。全市“千吨万人”推进会召开后，县政府主要领导立即批示开展部署，迅速组织召开专题会议，召集相关乡镇、部门逐条认领整改问题。\n　　二是措施明确，责任到位。县政府以文件形式制定下", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/hjjg/202007/t20200720_1552185.htm", "docreltime": "2020.07.20 17:34:00", "doctitle": "将乐县完成“千吨万人”乡镇饮用水源地环境问题整治", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1634902, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/hjjg/202007/t20200720_1552185.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/hjjg/202007/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1544050, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "环境监管", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/hjjg/202006/t20200624_1544050.htm", "content": "\n　　为有效推动第二轮中央生态环境保护督察信访件、市领导挂钩突出生态环境问题及市政协涉污提案的整改进展和成效，梅列区纪委监委和驻市生态环境局纪检组主要负责人，于6月18日共同前往梅列区鸿华源生态养殖有限公", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/hjjg/202006/t20200624_1544050.htm", "docreltime": "2020.06.24 17:27:00", "doctitle": "密切协作 合力治污 共同推动生态环境问题整改", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1625903, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/hjjg/202006/t20200624_1544050.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/hjjg/202006/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1538640, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "环境监管", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/hjjg/202006/t20200605_1538640.htm", "content": "\n　　近日，三明市生态环境局到永安市开展尼葛开发区及周边环境问题强化监督帮扶工作，全力以赴抓好中央生态环境保护督察反馈问题及信件整改，切实解决永安市尼葛开发区异味扰民问题，全力化解生态环境保护难题积案，", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/hjjg/202006/t20200605_1538640.htm", "docreltime": "2020.06.05 16:08:00", "doctitle": "三明市生态环境局到永安开展强化监督帮扶工作", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1619802, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/hjjg/202006/t20200605_1538640.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/hjjg/202006/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1533002, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "环境监管", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/hjjg/202005/t20200520_1533002.htm", "content": "\n　　一是用智“治”异味。研究制定《小蕉工业区突出环境问题专项整治工作方案》，建立联席会议制度，督促4家涉及异味企业制定“一企一策”整治方案，邀请行业专家评审，拟采取在生产区域加装完善废气收集罩、活性炭", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/hjjg/202005/t20200520_1533002.htm", "docreltime": "2020.05.20 17:30:00", "doctitle": "梅列小蕉化工园区异味治理初见成效", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1613375, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/hjjg/202005/t20200520_1533002.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/hjjg/202005/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1529606, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "环境监管", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/hjjg/202005/t20200512_1529606.htm", "content": "\n　　一是加强水质监测。组织环境质量股、环境监测站到现场布设点位进行采样监测，对数据指标进行分析，找准存在的问题，第一时间掌握水质状况。二是推进项目治理。在完成一期水生态修复项目的基础上，全力推进投资9", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/hjjg/202005/t20200512_1529606.htm", "docreltime": "2020.05.12 16:04:00", "doctitle": "大田县全力提升闽湖水质", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1609589, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/hjjg/202005/t20200512_1529606.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/hjjg/202005/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1522170, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "环境监管", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/hjjg/202004/t20200414_1522170.htm", "content": "\n　　近日，三明市生态环境局、三元生态环境局、莘口镇政府联合组织莘口镇生态管护队进行生态环保网格化培训。\n　　培训会上就网格员工作职责、环保网格化监管工作流程、环境保护相关法律法规等内容进行了详细讲解，", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/hjjg/202004/t20200414_1522170.htm", "docreltime": "2020.04.14 16:11:00", "doctitle": "市、区、乡三级联合开展莘口镇生态环保网格培训", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1601264, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/hjjg/202004/t20200414_1522170.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/hjjg/202004/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1484577, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "环境监管", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/hjjg/202003/t20200323_1484577.htm", "content": "\n　　一是主动担当,立即行动。2020年1月，市生态环境局组织对全市危险化学品等重点行业领域开展环境安全隐患集中整治；为深刻汲取“3·7”泉州酒店坍塌事故教训，进一步消除环境安全隐患，市生态环境局立即召开党组会", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/hjjg/202003/t20200323_1484577.htm", "docreltime": "2020.03.23 11:46:00", "doctitle": "我市牢筑环境安全防线", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1563202, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/hjjg/202003/t20200323_1484577.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/hjjg/202003/", "rels": []}]}